    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d187">

                <pb facs="0454" n="358" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg358"/>

                <head>No. 166.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Everett to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-01-06"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 6, 1879</date>.
                        (Received January 27.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 67.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose the resolutions
                    on the death of the late minister passed at the meeting of American residents in
                    Berlin, <pb facs="0455" n="359" xml:id="pg359"/> held in the American chapel on
                    the 22d December, 1878. A duplicate copy of the same is in the archives of the
                    legation.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>H. SIDNEY EVERETT.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d187-a1.xml" xpointer="d187-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
